6666 \text{ seconds} = \left\lfloor \frac{6666}{3600} \right\rfloor \text{ hours} + \left\lfloor \frac{6666 \text{ mod } 3600}{60} \right\rfloor \text{ minutes} + (6666 \text{ mod } 60) \text{ seconds}
\] \[
6666 \text{ seconds} = 1 \text{ hour} + 37 \text{ minutes} + 46 \text{ seconds}
\] Now, add this to the current time of 3:00:00 p.m.: \[
3 \text{ hours} + 1 \text{ hour} = 4 \text{ hours}
\] \[
0 \text{ minutes} + 37 \text{ minutes} = 37 \text{ minutes}
